messages.en:
{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Good morning{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}
So you're a morning person,
too, are you? {01 00 00 0a 00}I thought so!
{07 00 00}And since you're so peppy,{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 11 00}maybe you can give me a
hand cleaning up.

messages.et:
{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tere hommikust{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}
Nii et sina oled ka
hommikuinimene? {01 00 00 0a 00}Ma arvasin!
{07 00 00}Ja kuna sa oled nii reibas,{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 11 00}ehk aitad mul natuke
koristada.

messages.en:
{07 04 00}Yeow, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}! {01 00 00 0a 00}Do you
know what time it is?{01 01 00}
{07 11 00}You're a total night owl!
{07 06 00}I'm such a morning person,{01 00 00 05 00}
I get sleepy as soon as the
sun goes down, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 04 00}Ohoo, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}! {01 00 00 0a 00}Kas sa
tead, mis kell on?{01 01 00}
{07 11 00}Sa oled täielik öökull!
{07 06 00}Ma olen nii hommikuinimene,{01 00 00 05 00}
et jään magama kohe, kui
päike loojub, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!
